<p><strong>Monitoring approved developments</strong></p>
<p>If the application is approved, the relevant local planning authority monitors the development.</p>
<p>They will check that the work follows the approved plans and any planning conditions.</p>
<p><strong>Challenging a decision</strong></p>
<p>You can apply to the High Court for a judicial review if you want to challenge the decision. You must submit your application to the High Court within 6 weeks of the decision date.</p>
